WEBVTT

00:00.770 --> 00:03.440
What is this place?

00:08.430 --> 00:10.410
It has been quite a long time.

00:10.410 --> 00:11.340
Huh?

00:11.730 --> 00:14.410
Do you know him?

00:14.410 --> 00:16.410
Y-You're...

00:17.880 --> 00:19.640
Gibungle.

00:19.640 --> 00:23.670
I've been looking for you for twenty years!

00:23.670 --> 00:25.170
Master!

00:33.490 --> 00:34.830
Never heard of you.

00:38.350 --> 00:43.480
<i>That world I had always envisioned</i>

00:43.480 --> 00:47.100
<i>Could I have found it?</i>

00:55.990 --> 01:00.580
<i>I lived my days at someone 
else's convenience</i>

01:01.040 --> 01:05.210
<i>Gaining nothing but compromises and regrets</i>

01:05.210 --> 01:07.370
<i>Because I always felt that</i>

01:07.370 --> 01:11.250
<i>Even if it wasn't me standing here</i>

01:11.250 --> 01:15.300
<i>The world would still keep moving forward</i>

01:15.300 --> 01:19.100
<i>Even after I lost it</i>

01:19.100 --> 01:21.390
<i>And its colors faded</i>

01:21.390 --> 01:25.480
<i>The dream from that hazily remembered day</i>

01:25.480 --> 01:27.440
<i>Still remained</i>

01:27.440 --> 01:29.860
<i>The thing that only I can do</i>

01:29.860 --> 01:32.570
<i>And the scenery that I left behind</i>

01:32.570 --> 01:40.070
<i>I was just looking for an answer 
from some other time</i>

01:41.410 --> 01:46.290
<i>Those things that don't change</i>

01:46.290 --> 01:51.840
<i>And those words I protected so carefully</i>

01:51.840 --> 01:56.510
<i>Even if they're all just 
unattractive junk to others</i>

01:56.510 --> 02:04.890
<i>They're all treasures 
that I will never give up</i>

02:10.750 --> 02:12.480
Master?

02:12.480 --> 02:13.950
What does he mean?

02:13.950 --> 02:15.000
No idea!

02:15.000 --> 02:17.000
I only take women as apprentices!

02:18.770 --> 02:22.240
It seems it has been quite some time 
since you lost your memories.

02:23.360 --> 02:28.500
Master, you were a renowned 
magician in a land far to the east.

02:28.500 --> 02:33.480
But twenty years ago, you left on a journey, 
looking for forbidden magic,

02:33.480 --> 02:36.000
and you never returned.

02:37.020 --> 02:40.520
And now he's finally been found?

02:40.520 --> 02:43.370
I caught sight of you at 
the entrance to the great labyrinth,

02:43.370 --> 02:46.810
and I've been awaiting 
an opportunity to speak to you.

02:47.520 --> 02:49.460
Twenty years ago...

02:49.460 --> 02:51.460
That's before he met me.

02:51.460 --> 02:55.030
Geezer, you said you'd forgotten 
what happened in the past, didn't you?

02:57.180 --> 02:59.580
I wasn't lying.

02:59.580 --> 03:03.030
Other than the name Morlock and my magic,

03:03.030 --> 03:05.030
I really can't remember anything.

03:05.030 --> 03:09.210
And lately, your skill with magic 
has been making you look pretty useless.

03:09.210 --> 03:10.280
All of you...

03:10.560 --> 03:13.990
He is a great mage. Aren't you 
speaking too harshly to him?

03:13.990 --> 03:16.680
A great mage? This jerk?

03:17.290 --> 03:18.300
Master...

03:18.300 --> 03:24.050
Morlock is one of the pseudonyms you 
used when courting women, isn't it?

03:24.600 --> 03:25.690
Women?

03:25.690 --> 03:27.050
Master,

03:27.050 --> 03:30.130
you were quite popular with the ladies.

03:30.130 --> 03:32.640
Why does Beardy here 
seem so happy about that?

03:34.020 --> 03:35.060
Master.

03:35.060 --> 03:37.560
Master, your true name is...

03:42.080 --> 03:44.730
Great Mage Bergheim!

03:44.730 --> 03:46.280
Bergheim Crom...

03:52.800 --> 03:54.280
A kunai?!

03:55.980 --> 03:57.500
Saitou, the shield!

03:57.500 --> 03:58.530
Right!

03:58.530 --> 04:00.040
Lafanpan, treat him!

04:00.040 --> 04:01.700
Leave Beardy to me!

04:04.920 --> 04:06.760
<i>Is it that ninja from earlier?</i>

04:07.310 --> 04:11.280
<i>He's formidable, but with Saitou 
supporting the geezer's spells,</i>

04:11.280 --> 04:13.350
<i>we have the greater fighting power!</i>

04:14.750 --> 04:15.820
<i>We can win!</i>

04:27.570 --> 04:28.270
What?

04:32.870 --> 04:36.080
<b>Greater Demons</b>

04:32.920 --> 04:34.630
Greater demons?!

04:36.130 --> 04:39.550
<b>The Witch Who 
Has Lived 400 Years</b>

04:39.560 --> 04:43.710
Boss, did you really find 
the witch's house?

04:43.710 --> 04:45.800
That's a ninja for you!

04:45.800 --> 04:49.320
Actually, isn't it bad 
to show up with no warning?

04:51.620 --> 04:53.980
I cannot stop these feelings.

05:00.700 --> 05:02.770
It should be in this area.

05:03.700 --> 05:05.390
Let's split up and search.

05:05.390 --> 05:08.160
It'd be scary to run into her, though.

06:28.200 --> 06:30.650
Do you still live?

06:35.910 --> 06:37.840
Careful, boy.

06:37.840 --> 06:38.940
It can't be!

06:38.940 --> 06:40.200
Don't look!

06:45.720 --> 06:49.170
The witch Rahvella will soon die of old age.

06:51.360 --> 06:53.300
What's going on?

06:53.300 --> 06:55.310
When I met her before, she was...

06:57.360 --> 07:00.480
Long ago, Rahvella was bewitched by a demon,

07:00.480 --> 07:03.220
and magic was cast on her 
which stopped her aging.

07:04.150 --> 07:07.460
That demon was killed 
by a different magician,

07:07.460 --> 07:09.800
and only the effects of its magic remained.

07:10.900 --> 07:15.320
But this magic had one more curse within it.

07:19.740 --> 07:22.330
If she falls in love, 
the spell will be broken...

07:22.330 --> 07:26.290
and all that frozen time 
will return all at once.

07:27.830 --> 07:29.250
Love?

07:32.350 --> 07:35.010
Because she fell in love with you,

07:35.010 --> 07:37.760
time has once again begun 
moving for the witch.

07:48.870 --> 07:53.360
This is... because of me?

08:00.740 --> 08:02.150
Are you crying?

08:02.640 --> 08:04.360
Even though you're an assassin?

08:04.890 --> 08:07.590
How unexpected. Then, you were in earnest.

08:07.590 --> 08:09.900
In that case, I'll tell 
you something special.

08:10.570 --> 08:13.880
There is exactly one chance 
to save the witch.

08:16.580 --> 08:19.880
There are ruins in which a mage 
who can control time is said to live...

08:19.880 --> 08:21.800
the great labyrinth.

08:28.080 --> 08:29.710
Shadow Binding.

08:30.900 --> 08:32.420
<i>Magic Light?</i>

08:32.420 --> 08:35.010
This is the work of that moonlight fairy!

08:36.070 --> 08:37.670
Be careful!

08:37.670 --> 08:40.240
If he steps on your shadow, 
you won't be able to move!

08:40.240 --> 08:41.570
I know!

08:41.850 --> 08:44.360
I've healed the dwarf magician.

08:44.360 --> 08:46.570
All we can do is leave that side to him.

08:48.740 --> 08:49.330
Tch.

08:51.880 --> 08:55.040
Master, I will stop his attacks!

08:55.040 --> 08:57.480
Use that time for your incantations!

08:58.360 --> 08:59.600
Morlock-san!

08:59.600 --> 09:02.920
Oh, uh... W-We'll do a Fiery Heat Blast.

09:04.150 --> 09:06.250
To think you're able to withstand my fists!

09:06.250 --> 09:09.320
Have you strengthened 
your shield with magic?

09:15.210 --> 09:16.550
Tch.

09:16.550 --> 09:18.520
Leave the finishing blow to me.

09:18.520 --> 09:23.000
We of the House of the Demon King 
have no need to chant incantations.

09:30.540 --> 09:31.720
Master!

09:31.720 --> 09:35.520
They won't be defeated 
by a Fiery Heat Blast!

09:35.520 --> 09:37.510
You may say that, but...

09:41.320 --> 09:42.840
<i>It's because of me.</i>

09:43.260 --> 09:46.400
<i>It's because I barged in here!</i>

09:48.230 --> 09:49.430
Morlock-san!

09:49.430 --> 09:49.980
Huh?

09:49.980 --> 09:52.320
You can use a higher-tier magic!

09:52.590 --> 09:56.380
I-In that case, um...

09:56.380 --> 09:58.480
I'll do Seven Thunder Gods!

09:58.480 --> 09:59.770
Can you do it?

10:00.080 --> 10:01.240
I have it memorized!

10:01.240 --> 10:02.040
Good.

10:02.450 --> 10:04.090
Seven thunderbolts in formation...

10:04.410 --> 10:10.840
six blasts, five swords, four spears, 
three are... three are...

10:10.840 --> 10:12.290
Three are my fangs!

10:12.290 --> 10:13.470
That's right!

10:13.470 --> 10:15.560
Three are my fangs!

10:15.560 --> 10:16.810
Two are my arms...

10:16.810 --> 10:18.960
These words unleashed by my mind...

10:18.960 --> 10:20.510
shall become blades of lightning!

10:22.430 --> 10:24.880
Explode, Thunder Gods!

10:34.020 --> 10:35.250
You did it!

10:35.250 --> 10:36.800
Wait, Saitou!

10:39.110 --> 10:40.320
You and your silly tricks...

10:40.320 --> 10:42.160
You're an eyesore!

10:49.590 --> 10:51.200
Die.

10:51.670 --> 10:54.160
Saitou!

11:04.600 --> 11:05.490
What?

11:06.440 --> 11:09.010
Duplicate substitution magic!

11:09.010 --> 11:09.860
Down there!

11:09.860 --> 11:11.480
Don't let down your guard!

11:12.730 --> 11:17.160
I can use the skills of a thief 
and the magic of a conjurer...

11:17.160 --> 11:19.230
I can trick even a demon.

11:19.230 --> 11:20.760
Guivre-san!

11:20.760 --> 11:23.020
And Magical Beast Hunter Liliza!

11:23.020 --> 11:25.480
We heard that all of you were down here,

11:25.480 --> 11:28.830
so we came because we couldn't 
let you take all the treasure.

11:28.940 --> 11:31.990
Beardy here is stalking you, Saitou,

11:32.000 --> 11:34.260
so he's been tracking you with magic.

11:34.640 --> 11:36.130
It was them?

11:36.130 --> 11:37.250
Tch.

11:38.390 --> 11:40.470
Don't look down on us!

11:42.040 --> 11:43.110
Here he comes!

11:56.490 --> 11:58.550
Looks like you're having some trouble,

11:58.550 --> 12:00.400
Armored Warrior Raelza.

12:00.610 --> 12:02.480
Forest Elf Warrior...

12:02.480 --> 12:04.530
Flanril Arlil!

12:05.200 --> 12:06.530
You...

12:15.160 --> 12:17.840
What? A barrier?!

12:18.080 --> 12:20.670
Master Saitou! I've come to save you!

12:20.670 --> 12:23.170
A-And so has the hero, Cainz!

12:23.170 --> 12:24.480
And Rychee, too!

12:24.720 --> 12:27.830
Monpui-san! And the hero and magician, too!

12:28.920 --> 12:32.550
Since you're the ones who found the 
hidden passage, and you went so deep inside,

12:32.550 --> 12:37.440
everyone noticed and thought 
there might be something here!

12:43.390 --> 12:45.570
Why are there so many?

12:46.000 --> 12:48.420
Tahlefon! Ableth! We're pulling out!

12:49.000 --> 12:50.080
Boss!

12:50.080 --> 12:51.470
Miss Lafanpan!

12:51.470 --> 12:52.910
We shouldn't let them get away!

12:52.910 --> 12:54.070
Ninia?

12:54.070 --> 12:58.200
They've been going around taking down 
even high-level adventurers with ambushes.

12:58.660 --> 13:02.410
We should use combined magics 
to eradicate them!

13:02.410 --> 13:03.340
Understood!

13:04.920 --> 13:06.340
Primasse!

13:09.730 --> 13:11.750
Drive away that of the darkness...

13:11.750 --> 13:13.520
End all that which is of gloom...

13:13.520 --> 13:15.440
I won't let you!

13:17.920 --> 13:19.030
Who was that?

13:19.030 --> 13:21.280
What do you think of that? Hurts, right?

13:21.280 --> 13:24.280
That's Idol Magician Rychee's Magic Arrow!

13:24.280 --> 13:25.470
Little fairy!

13:25.470 --> 13:26.410
Fool!

13:26.410 --> 13:27.920
Don't approach them without thinking!

13:28.290 --> 13:30.740
The two mid-levels are doing 
a demon banishment!

13:30.740 --> 13:32.660
It's high-tier magic!

13:33.410 --> 13:35.960
The white door opens.

13:35.960 --> 13:38.080
Demonstrate the might of the heavens' army.

13:38.080 --> 13:39.270
Divine Spirit...

13:39.270 --> 13:40.360
...Light Shot!

13:42.080 --> 13:43.950
<i>I am an assassin.</i>

13:43.950 --> 13:46.580
<i>I've killed so many people for money.</i>

13:56.180 --> 13:58.150
<i>In a world of darkness,</i>

13:58.150 --> 14:01.690
<i>I, who have been used for the 
convenience of others, found friends...</i>

14:01.690 --> 14:02.680
<i>Demons.</i>

14:18.800 --> 14:20.520
I'll be a laughingstock!

14:21.210 --> 14:23.210
Protecting a demon...

14:26.340 --> 14:28.390
and dying for it.

14:36.590 --> 14:37.890
B-Boss...

14:38.840 --> 14:40.400
Why did you do that?

14:40.400 --> 14:41.740
What about you?

14:42.120 --> 14:46.900
This expedition is something I'm doing 
for the sake of the woman I love.

14:46.900 --> 14:50.160
You have no obligation to follow me here.

14:50.160 --> 14:52.410
Wh-What are you saying?

14:52.780 --> 14:55.420
Don't be a stranger!

14:55.420 --> 14:58.410
Don't be a stranger?

14:58.410 --> 15:00.780
Those words... I'll turn 
them right back on you!

15:02.590 --> 15:05.160
An assassin's alignment is evil.

15:05.160 --> 15:07.340
Even if it wasn't as effective 
as it would be on a demon,

15:07.340 --> 15:10.830
the damage from the Divine Spirit 
Light Shot should be severe.

15:10.830 --> 15:14.100
A bond strong enough 
that he'd protect a demon...

15:23.210 --> 15:25.110
Let's just stop this!

15:27.110 --> 15:28.600
Saitou...

15:28.600 --> 15:31.120
The winner's already decided, right?

15:31.430 --> 15:32.440
No!

15:32.440 --> 15:36.520
They are under suspicion of ambushing 
other adventurers and killing them!

15:36.520 --> 15:38.160
We cannot allow them to escape!

15:38.160 --> 15:39.120
That's right!

15:39.120 --> 15:42.280
It won't end here! It can't!

15:42.280 --> 15:43.430
Primasse!

15:44.120 --> 15:48.920
We won't let anyone else have the hidden 
treasure of the wizard who controls time!

15:49.760 --> 15:52.140
I offer these wings of black.

15:52.140 --> 15:53.970
Hear me, o Lord of Darkness.

15:53.970 --> 15:56.620
Your body is mine. My body is yours.

15:56.620 --> 15:57.760
Primasse!

15:58.740 --> 16:01.770
This is the only way 
if you want to save the witch!

16:01.770 --> 16:03.160
It can't be.

16:03.160 --> 16:05.770
That's a tier-eight dark 
spirit summoning spell!

16:05.770 --> 16:08.760
Is that fairy a good 
enough magician to do that?

16:08.760 --> 16:10.820
Yes, she can!

16:10.820 --> 16:15.280
Black crystal fairies can store 
magical energy in their black wings!

16:18.330 --> 16:19.860
Don't lose your nerve!

16:19.860 --> 16:21.600
You're an assassin, aren't you?

16:22.230 --> 16:26.080
Pull those wings off 
and release the magical energy!

16:26.330 --> 16:27.640
Little fairy...

16:27.640 --> 16:29.470
B-Boss?

16:29.470 --> 16:30.510
Do it!

16:30.510 --> 16:33.760
Do it to save my best friend!

16:35.140 --> 16:36.720
I'm sorry.

16:39.760 --> 16:43.690
<b>The Fairy with 
Black Wings</b>

16:44.270 --> 16:49.190
<b>"Black Crystal Fairies"

Fairies which are just 
as beautiful as 
moonlight fairies... 
It is thought that there
 are only a few in the 
kingdom.</b>

16:55.200 --> 16:59.820
<i>A number of adventurers 
have come to capture me.</i>

16:56.960 --> 16:58.060
Stop!

16:58.060 --> 16:59.080
Catch her!

16:59.080 --> 17:00.690
We'll never want for food again!

17:00.330 --> 17:04.210
<i>That's why I hate adventurers.</i>

17:04.210 --> 17:06.720
<i>And so I had an idea.</i>

17:06.720 --> 17:09.200
<i>If I became a plump fairy...</i>

17:09.200 --> 17:11.710
<i>then humans wouldn't be 
interested in me anymore.</i>

17:11.710 --> 17:14.470
<i>With that in mind, I got fatter.</i>

17:14.470 --> 17:15.860
She's plump!

17:15.080 --> 17:16.170
<i>But...</i>

17:15.860 --> 17:16.920
That's a rare fairy!

17:16.920 --> 17:18.300
<i>Why?</i>

17:17.260 --> 17:19.760
I've never seen one before!

17:18.300 --> 17:20.470
<i>My body is so heavy!</i>

17:20.840 --> 17:23.800
<i>Getting fat slowed my movements...</i>

17:24.340 --> 17:26.480
<i>and I ended up getting caught.</i>

17:27.820 --> 17:30.160
Help! Someone!

17:28.200 --> 17:30.160
This'll fetch a high price!

17:30.160 --> 17:31.600
Let her go.

17:32.100 --> 17:34.480
No one asked you! Don't inter...fere...

17:34.480 --> 17:36.140
A-A witch!

17:36.140 --> 17:37.880
Th-This is bad!

17:38.190 --> 17:40.090
Blast it!

17:38.190 --> 17:40.100
Run!

17:40.960 --> 17:43.590
I-I caught this myself!

17:43.590 --> 17:46.410
No one gets to complain... about...

17:50.250 --> 17:51.960
Thank you.

17:52.320 --> 17:54.040
You're quite welcome.

17:56.170 --> 17:59.270
<i>That's how I met Rahvella.</i>

18:00.790 --> 18:04.210
<i>We became friends right away.</i>

18:05.160 --> 18:08.680
<i>I think that since we were both 
outcasts, we got along well.</i>

18:10.250 --> 18:11.690
It's delicious!

18:11.690 --> 18:14.150
I've never had anything this delicious!

18:14.150 --> 18:16.940
It's a specialty of mine, baking scones.

18:18.390 --> 18:20.650
<i>We talked about all kinds of things.</i>

18:28.400 --> 18:30.560
Aren't you lonely?

18:30.560 --> 18:34.280
Living in a place like this,
like some kind of castaway?

18:35.740 --> 18:37.180
I suppose so.

18:37.850 --> 18:39.670
I've grown used to it.

18:39.670 --> 18:41.960
I have lived four hundred years, after all.

18:41.960 --> 18:45.840
Four hundred years? That's a very long time.

18:46.410 --> 18:49.040
That's the curse I'm under.

18:49.040 --> 18:53.390
But if I fall in love, 
the curse will break and I will die.

18:53.390 --> 18:54.440
What?

18:58.710 --> 19:00.020
<i>"Don't worry."</i>

19:00.020 --> 19:04.190
<i>"I've lived so long that I left love 
behind some time ago."</i>

19:04.190 --> 19:05.580
<i>That's what she told me.</i>

19:06.760 --> 19:09.500
<i>And so, I felt reassured.</i>

19:11.120 --> 19:13.330
I've been kissed.

19:13.330 --> 19:14.520
What?

19:15.080 --> 19:16.520
It's all right.

19:16.520 --> 19:19.090
How long do you think I've lived?

19:19.090 --> 19:22.470
An elf friend I had long ago told me...

19:23.860 --> 19:25.230
Told you what?

19:25.230 --> 19:29.220
That no matter how old a woman gets, 
she will still fall in love.

19:32.590 --> 19:34.770
What are you doing?!

19:34.770 --> 19:37.240
If you don't tear off my wings...

19:37.240 --> 19:40.170
I can't summon the dark spirit!

19:42.480 --> 19:44.440
A dark spirit summoning?

19:44.440 --> 19:45.850
I won't let you!

19:45.850 --> 19:47.280
Let's go stop her, Armored Warrior!

19:47.280 --> 19:48.120
Yes.

19:48.120 --> 19:50.620
Boss! Little fairy!

19:50.620 --> 19:53.000
We're prepared for the worst!

19:53.000 --> 19:55.380
Let us at least buy you time!

19:55.380 --> 19:57.880
Hurry up, Kisurugi!

19:57.880 --> 20:00.100
Hurry up, Kisurugi!

20:00.100 --> 20:02.580
Rip off my wings!

20:02.580 --> 20:06.020
Release the magic energy stored in them!

20:06.020 --> 20:08.850
Can't you do it? You coward!

20:08.850 --> 20:10.350
Coward!

20:10.350 --> 20:12.720
You cowardly ninja!

20:13.220 --> 20:16.520
Enough! I'll do it myself!

20:16.520 --> 20:18.040
Telekinesis!

20:18.400 --> 20:20.280
My kunai?

20:20.280 --> 20:22.870
Primasse! Don't!

20:22.870 --> 20:24.190
What are you doing?!

20:30.440 --> 20:32.700
<i>Y-You...</i>

20:35.200 --> 20:37.840
That fairy did that to herself!

20:37.840 --> 20:39.400
Unseen Hand.

20:39.400 --> 20:41.450
A type of telekinesis magic.

20:42.360 --> 20:44.650
<i>I hate adventurers.</i>

20:45.070 --> 20:47.230
<i>Has it ever happened to any of you?</i>

20:47.230 --> 20:49.400
<i>Being surrounded by obsessed eccentrics,</i>

20:49.400 --> 20:53.250
<i>and nearly being forced to breed 
with a different species.</i>

20:55.720 --> 20:56.550
<i>Rahvella...</i>

20:57.220 --> 21:01.110
<i>You saved me. You are my only friend.</i>

21:01.770 --> 21:03.830
<i>This time, I...</i>

21:05.010 --> 21:07.990
<i>I promise I will save you!</i>

21:13.940 --> 21:16.340
I offer these wings of black.

21:16.340 --> 21:18.600
Hear me, o Lord of Darkness.

21:18.600 --> 21:22.060
Your body is mine. My body is yours.

21:22.710 --> 21:25.170
Together we drift over the river prison.

21:25.590 --> 21:29.670
My servant. Evildoer. Dark spirit!

21:29.670 --> 21:31.090
Dark spirit!

21:31.140 --> 21:34.620
Come, young lord of deepest black steel!

21:41.280 --> 21:43.770
Wh-What is that?

21:43.770 --> 21:45.780
That's a dark spirit?

21:45.780 --> 21:47.920
A-A pillar?

21:51.950 --> 21:54.160
Get back, Flanril!

22:02.460 --> 22:03.970
No!

22:30.030 --> 22:32.830
<i>Like being gently carried away on a current</i>

22:32.830 --> 22:35.490
<i>Like drifting off to sleep at night</i>

22:35.490 --> 22:37.740
<i>Like there's nothing 
particularly special about it</i>

22:37.740 --> 22:39.720
<i>Our hearts are one</i>

22:39.720 --> 22:42.560
<i>“See you later” illuminates the way</i>

22:42.560 --> 22:44.570
<i>To the depths of the future</i>

22:44.570 --> 22:49.450
<i>Where kindness is the one 
thing I'm certain I felt</i>

22:49.450 --> 22:54.430
<i>You know, I'm sure we 
don't know anything</i>

22:54.430 --> 22:59.380
<i>But you know, for right now, that’s fine</i>

22:59.380 --> 23:02.060
<i>I'm waiting, I'm waiting</i>

23:02.060 --> 23:04.220
<i>Let's sing here again</i>

23:04.220 --> 23:07.010
<i>One day, we'll shine the light</i>

23:07.010 --> 23:09.690
<i>Now, I think I can embrace even my tears</i>

23:09.690 --> 23:11.800
<i>As we picture it, as we paint it</i>

23:11.800 --> 23:13.940
<i>A single bit of warmth is all there is</i>

23:13.940 --> 23:20.500
<i>And now, so that we can 
laugh, let's hold hands</i>

23:20.500 --> 23:26.360
<i>That’s right, it will 
blossom in the skies</i>

23:26.360 --> 23:32.510
<i>A guidepost showing us the way to live</i>
